This repo shares one memory across Claude Code, Cursor and Codex.

- Read `AGENTS.md` (the single source of truth) and `.agent/memory.jsonl` at the
  start of each session to recover prior decisions. Newest entries are last.
- After a notable decision or change, append one line to `.agent/memory.jsonl`:

  ```bash
  node scripts/remember.mjs cursor decision "<short summary>" [tag1,tag2]
  ```

- The memory is append-only — never edit or delete existing lines.

Full convention: `.agent/README.md`.
